     5390   ON CHOOSE OF b-sum-doc IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     5391   DO:
     5392     run str/vsumtype.w ( input yes, input bf_trn-doc.doc-code, input ? ).
     5393   END.
     5394   ON CHOOSE OF b-sum-goods IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
     5395   DO:
     5396     if available bf_goods then do:
     5397       run str/vsumtype.w ( input no, input bf_trn-doc.doc-code, input bf_goods.gds-code ).
     5398     end.
     5399     ELSE DO:
