     5444     run local-psn-chk in this-procedure ("wrkr", "button").
     5445     apply "entry" to varagnt in frame Dialog-Frame.
     5446     return no-apply.
     5447   END.
     5448   ON LEAVE OF varagnt IN FRAME Dialog-Frame
